  misc={"er_ser_protein": ("Smooth ER makes proteins because it has ribosomes.", "The Smooth ER does not have ribosomes on its surface and is involved in the synthesis and storage of fats and hormones; the Rough ER has ribosomes and is involved in protein synthesis.")},
